[57.205254, "o", "PATCH rot_badge_class        ROT_LOCATOR     widget with tag/position/text signature of .cart-count found under .cc; class-only change\r\nPATCH rot_cart_lines_count   ROT_LOCATOR     all 2 expected items are present under .c-row; class-only change from .cart-line\r\nPATCH copy_buy_button        UI_COPY_CHANGE  widget at same position now reads 'Add item' (was 'Add to cart'); copy change, needs human confirmation it was intentional\r\nKEEP  reg_price_kettle       REGRESSION      element .p-cost exists but shows '$60.50', expected '$48.00'; value assertion, never patch the expectation\r\nKEEP  reg_badge_gone         REGRESSION      no structural analog of .cart-count on the current page; assume product regression until a human says otherwise\r\nverification: GREEN (3/3 consecutive runs passed)\r\nbundle: prs/selfheal-20261122-1520/ (nothing applied; merge is the human command)\r\n"]
